<title>USA: SurVivaLink wins patent for new technology.</title>
<headline>SurVivaLink wins patent for new technology.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>SurVivaLink Corp said Monday it received a patent for its technology that regulates electrical leaks for its automated defibrillation devices.</p>
<p>The technology protects patients and rescue teams from any electrical mishap that could occur during a cardiac arrest rescue, the company said.</p>
<p>SurVivaLink designs and makes external defibrillators used to treat victims of sudden cardiac arrest.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
